  },
  "rules": [
    "Generated live status never overrides workbook frontmatter.",
    "Chat/dashboard prose is not a claim lock.",
    "A Utopia implementation claim must name an exact commit and its CI state.",
    "Linkage commits must not be interpreted as product capability changes."
  ]
